            "body": "> I'd assume that `i` puts the cursor at the previous character, while `a` keeps it at the current character, since pressing `<Esc>` after `i` moves the cursor one character to the left.\n\nHmm... judging by the cursor highlight in Insert mode near any colored text, I am wrong. The current behavior seems more correct regarding where the selection starts.\n\nHowever, I still think the selection position at the end is incorrect.",
