        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\n\nI can indeed reproduce. The main culprit here is that `select_textobject` was and is never meant to be used in Insert mode. In fact, I am fairly surprised that this works as it is (not even sure about this `INSERT VISUAL` mode).\n\nThe way it currently works is as expected since the cursor *is* on correct cell, it is just that `select_textobject` assumes inclusive selection.\n\nI'll take a look if the current solution for `set selection=exclusive` option value can be applied here. But if there is no easy approach, I am inclined to close this as not planned since selection in Insert mode is not something common (and can be prepended by explicitly exiting into a Normal mode, I guess).",
